    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Piercing Arrow",
          "desc": "Deals double damage to shields with Basic Attacks and skills."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Enchanted Arrows",
          "desc": ";On: Range and Basic Attack interval increase. Basic Attack costs Mana and deals damage over time. ;Off: Gains Movement Speed and restores range and Basic Attack interval toinitial values.Basic Attack hits restore Mana."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Silent Arrow",
          "desc": "Fires an arrow in the target direction, dealing damage to enemies hit while silencing and slowing them. After a brief delay, deals another strike of damage to enemies within range of the same location."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Sphere of Purity",
          "desc": "Damages enemies in range. Gains Attack Speed and Critical Rate when in the magic circle.Use this skill again to grant Critical Rate and Move Speed to teammates in the circle and damage enemies in the circle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Long attack range",
          "Strong against shields",
          "Excellent late-game DPS"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Limited mobility",
          "Mana dependent",
          "Vulnerable to dives"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nFocus on farming in the early game and avoid unnecessary trades or fights until you get some attack speed and critical rate from your core items. Use Skill 2 Silent Arrow to poke the enemy and interrupt them from engaging. Remember, do not use Skill 1 when attacking minions or jungle monsters, as it will waste your mana, and you'll struggle to stay in lane.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, you want to stay behind your frontline and abuse your range advantage from Skill 1 Enchanted Arrows. Even though you don't have much mobility, the movement speed from your Ultimate Sphere of Purity can help with kiting in the late game. If you are chasing or kiting away from your Ultimate, make sure to use it again to break the circle so you can get some extra movement speed.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nOnly use Skill 1 when attacking heroes in trades and teamfights. Don't waste your mana attacking minions/monsters\nAlways try to position yourself inside Garo's Ultimate for the increased movement speed and critical rate."
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Jangkauan Garo unggul, incer pakai assassin yang dash-nya kuat. 2) Makin cepet tower di belakangnya ancur, makin kebatas dia."
    },
